  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6be890c8a758f3488227c7687955d0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1R5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "Nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1ED1m s\xE1ng \u0111\xF3... Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01A1n
      gi\u1EA3n, ch\xFAng l\xE0 m\u1EB7t t\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EA1i
      th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi Ani n\xE0y."
    textEN: Those sparks... they are no mere lights. They are the very dark side
      of the Great World of Ani.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "Ph\u1EA3i chi ta \u0111\u1EC3 \xFD ch\xFAng s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n, nh\u1EEFng
      \u0111\u1EE9a tr\u1EBB c\u1EE7a ta s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng sa ng\xE3 nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy."
    textEN: If only I had noticed them sooner, my children would never have fallen
      so far.
    AutoSkip: 0
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  IsActivated: 1
